ounds—as the \"bank.\" When they eventually fled the hideout, they were meticulous, wiping every doorknob and surface for evidence, but they completely ignored the game they had left sitting on the table. What game were they playing?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:48:39Z", "username": "Yash Agrawal", "text": "monopoly", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:48:41Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Monopoly?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:48:46Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Monopoly", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:48:49Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Smit: 20, Akshay: 10, Ricky: 5, Sal: 35, Yash B: 30, Pavan: 70, Yash A: 40", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:49:03Z", "username": "bijal bhatt", "text": "Super set @⁨~Chinmay Mehta⁩", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:49:04Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Pavan wins inspite of not being there for the last few questions!", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:49:05Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Yashes tied with Pavan", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:49:05Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Mast set @⁨~Chinmay Mehta⁩!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:49:06Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "As usual", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:49:09Z", "username": "Y